$ whycant exec /srv/app-arm64

✓ alice (uid 1000) can exec /srv/app-arm64

  /                drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv             drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv/app-arm64   -rwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ exec

Also noticed
  /srv/app-arm64: runs through qemu-aarch64 emulation
    /srv/app-arm64 is an aarch64 binary on an x86_64 machine; binfmt_misc hands it to qemu-aarch64.
